  "details": "Currently nothing is more annoying when trying to take a photo in vrchat then our avatars not looking at the damn camera, I can recall countless times where I've tried to take a photo while looking at the camera using the 5 second timer so I can get my pose just right and at the last second what always seems to happen? My avatar looks off in the distance, I'm proposing adding some sort of option that forces an avatar to stare directly at the camera lense, even if its only local this will make taking photos a much more pleasant experience",
